# Three-tier web application · a generic example.
# Edit, then re-render: plinth-sketch examples/three-tier.sketch

@layer Client
browser : Browser / SPA + traceparent

@layer Edge
cdn : CDN / TLS · cache
gw  : API Gateway / OIDC · rate-limit

@layer Application
web : Web tier / Next.js · React 19
api : API tier / Go · chi · pgx

@layer Data
db    : Postgres / OLTP
redis : Redis / cache · queues
s3    : Object storage / blobs

browser -> cdn
cdn -> gw : HTTP
gw -> web
gw -> api
web -> api : SSR · forms
api -> db
api -> redis
api -> s3
